				1.12
			</span></i>, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Vit.Hom.</u>
				33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>rising,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτμῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>CA</u>
					1.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> Astrol.,
